WEBVTT

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:18.820
That makes three!

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:22.360
Uh, how many more do we have to collect?

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:23.440
A lot?

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.920
Yeah, but how many is that?

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.840
Will knowing increase your 
chances of securing them?

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.440
No, but we'll know what we're in for.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:33.450
What's so funn—

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:36.120
Every single one in Pure Illusion.

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:37.220
That is all.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:39.730
Goodbye.

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:40.970
Cocona!

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:25.610
Welcome back.

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:32.240
What's the matter?

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:34.300
Did you have a bad dream?

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:38.840
I think I've been having 
the same dream lately.

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:41.160
Really? What kind of dream?

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:43.170
I'm not sure...

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:45.850
Could it be due to stress, perhaps?

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:47.650
Don't worry.

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:49.980
I'm always here if you need to talk.

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:51.200
Thanks.

00:02:57.180 --> 00:02:58.880
Maybe it'll be a bother, after all...

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:00.790
They're yummy, so it's okay.

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:01.770
But...

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.800
Did you bring me a poisoned apple?

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:05.000
Senpai!

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.080
We baked cookies in home ec class!

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:19.470
Irodori I

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:21.650
Looks like a barnacle.

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:26.490
Sorry! That one's mine!

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:28.730
These ones Papika made are good, so have—

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:35.500
Sweet.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:38.440
Goes well with the tea.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:46.200
Papika.

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:47.770
It stinks in here!

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:49.980
Could it be the nail polish?

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:51.000
Mail folish?

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.290
Nail polish.

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:55.750
I used some for a painting earlier.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:58.130
You can use it for more than just nails?

00:03:58.130 --> 00:03:59.140
Yeah.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:01.880
I don't paint my nails, though.

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:05.190
I don't have the right to.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.010
Then I'll paint mine!

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:09.100
No can do.

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:12.520
Why not? Come on!

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:16.470
Freshly painted!

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:17.880
They still haven't dried?

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:19.540
Wow, how pretty.

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:25.780
Oil paint is hard to take off, you know.

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:28.730
No, stop!

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:29.710
You'll get the equipment wet!

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:31.370
Cut it out!

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:31.750
Danger

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.170
The bubbles! The bubbles!

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:41.090
Keep it down!

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:42.420
Flip Flapping!

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:49.470
Flip Flapping!

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:02.180
Man, this thing's hard.

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:03.150
Cocona!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:03.940
I've got it!

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:08.200
Papika!

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:16.540
Nope! I'm over here!

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:29.220
Heya.

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:30.410
Yayaka!

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:31.060
No fair!

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:32.220
No fair?

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:33.390
No fair.

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:35.360
So what?

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:36.730
Give it back!

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:41.980
You won't hit me with that!

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:44.610
Damn it!

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:47.080
Let me go!

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:55.930
Are you okay?

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:57.500
Ta-da!

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:58.210
Papika!

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:05.500
Bu-chan!

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:09.580
Tch.

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:10.880
Let your guard down?

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:11.830
I did not—

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:14.060
Maybe a little.

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:15.580
Let's go.

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:18.820
Try transforming, Yayaka.

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:21.610
Huh? You two can, too?

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.840
Papika!

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:27.650
Bu-chan!

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:30.660
Papika.

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:32.070
What's wrong?

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:34.370
A rock?

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:36.420
What could it be?

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:50.210
An exit?

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.610
What's that hole?

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:53.830
Analyze it.

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:56.300
Coordinates aren't showing.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:06:59.530
Stay away! That's—

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:38.220
Auntie.

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:41.110
Sorry I'm late.

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:43.150
Shall we go in and have some snacks?

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:47.970
You're so good, Iro-chan.

00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:49.560
I'll mix it!

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:51.260
What about the milk?

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:52.780
I'll add it!

00:07:54.510 --> 00:07:55.770
Oh, my.

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:57.030
I'm sorry.

00:07:57.920 --> 00:08:00.200
Don't worry if you make a mess.

00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:07.670
Eww, an earthworm.

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:12.670
They eat the humus and make 
the soil more fertile.

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:15.210
Earthworms are great!

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:21.730
I wanna do that!

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:24.940
Then put your hands together like this.

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:43.980
It looks good.

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:47.800
Why are you hiding it?

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:50.220
Because it's weird.

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:51.380
Weird?

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:53.890
Daddy and Mommy called it weird.

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.390
They said to draw normally.

00:08:57.020 --> 00:08:58.230
Did they?

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:01.100
I thought it was nice.

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:09.060
Yes, it is a bit unusual.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.390
But in a good way.

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:12.280
I think it's very creative.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:17.860
You see, I used to be a school teacher.

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:18.970
A teacher?

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:19.780
Yes.

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.500
Until I got to the age 
where they told me to stop.

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:24.040
Yuki-sensei
Thank you for everything!
Class 3-1 Graduates

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:26.370
Ever since then, I've lived all by myself.

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:29.160
I'm the only one left of my generation.

00:09:30.780 --> 00:09:33.170
Do you think I'm weird?

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:35.040
No!

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:39.900
So you see, even if some people find 
something weird, it might not actually be.

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:42.310
I like that drawing.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:46.660
You can have this!

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:49.440
Are you sure? Thank you.

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:55.960
You'd better get home.

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:58.030
Your mother and father must be worried.

00:09:58.580 --> 00:09:59.540
Okay.

00:10:01.190 --> 00:10:04.750
After all, you're so adorable.

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:08.020
I can't breathe.

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:11.750
I'm sorry.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.090
Come again,

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:14.280
Iro-chan.

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:15.140
Okay!

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:21.710
Auntie!

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:23.120
Come in!

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:25.020
Auntie!

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:26.240
You're hurt?!

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:27.370
No.

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:27.980
Are they pretty?

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:32.820
I wanna do that, too!

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.110
When you're bigger.

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.080
Bigger?

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:46.040
Town News

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:46.040
Sankakuyama Literature Dept.

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:49.000
Did you draw this?

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.000
You can have it!

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:51.760
Are you sure?

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:53.170
It's a drawing of you.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.580
Thank you.

00:10:58.150 --> 00:10:59.000
Sure.

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:06.430
A red dragonfly in the red evening sky.

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:08.020
I wonder when I saw—

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:09.390
Hello.

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:10.640
Hello!

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:11.830
Hello.

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.860
Shall we head straight to your place?

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:19.220
I need to bring the veggies—

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:20.530
No!

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:28.770
Let's take a detour, then.

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:30.170
Okay.

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:36.580
Are they away?

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:38.090
Want to come back to my place?

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:38.900
Yeah.

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:50.390
I'm home.

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:52.230
Mommy?

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:53.400
Daddy?

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:12.120
Iro?

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:18.640
No!

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:20.550
No, you, too!

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:24.470
Switch with Iro, Iro!

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:33.730
All done.

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.010
I told you, I've got work!

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:36.220
That's all you ever do!

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:37.860
Mommy? Daddy?

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:37.860
You never do anything for the family!

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.320
Go back to your room, Iro.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:42.430
But my drawing...

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:43.820
Did you do your homework?

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:46.200
If you don't study hard, 
you'll end up like him.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.450
How dare you?

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:48.670
In front of our child?!

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:49.910
It's the truth, isn't it?!

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:56.460
Auntie! Auntie!

00:12:56.740 --> 00:12:57.960
Auntie!

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:02.460
Help me, Iro!

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.590
Switch with Iro!

00:13:05.070 --> 00:13:06.640
But Iro's Iro.

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:10.140
Iro's Iro, too!

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:20.850
My head hurts.

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:22.860
You two.

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:24.630
What happened in there?

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:26.980
Well, Iro...

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:28.570
I'm Iro.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:29.850
But I'm Iro.

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:30.620
Iro?

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:31.450
Iro.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.660
We're outta here. This feels risky.

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:45.180
They took it again.

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:47.760
Wanna head back?

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:51.890
You and I were both Iro.

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.180
Who's Iro?

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:56.320
I'm not certain, but something bothers me.

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:58.120
Wanna go back, then?

00:13:58.120 --> 00:13:59.000
Are you sure?

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:02.250
I haven't eaten Auntie's pancakes yet.

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:03.860
Pancakes?

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:05.520
But...

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:13.160
Let's go find out who we were.

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:14.830
One more time.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:20.710
Danger

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:25.560
Auntie!

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:30.650
Where did I put it?

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:32.560
How strange.

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:33.610
Auntie!

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:35.430
Oh, Iro-chan.

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:37.430
What are you looking for?

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:38.770
My makeup pouch.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:40.920
Where could I have put it?

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:42.520
There it is!

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:47.110
Oh, thank you.

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.360
It's always here.

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:52.080
Oh, right.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:56.620
It's amazing how you know me better than I do.

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:59.110
Hold out your hands, Iro-chan.

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:00.480
Will you really paint them?

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:01.840
Just a bit.

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:05.210
As thanks for finding my makeup pouch.

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:25.960
She keeps bringing a kid home.

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:27.640
Not a relative's kid?

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:29.130
She doesn't have any children.

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:30.860
Oh, so that's why.

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:34.580
She's old now. I wonder 
what'll happen when she dies.

00:15:43.490 --> 00:15:46.150
Oh, Iro-chan. Give me a second.

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:49.420
Are you tired?

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:50.260
No.

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:52.000
I'm fine.

00:15:54.190 --> 00:15:58.260
I have a present to give 
you when we get back.

00:15:58.550 --> 00:16:01.010
We already had a birthday party before.

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:02.560
Did we?

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:07.380
But celebrating a birthday never gets old.

00:16:07.380 --> 00:16:09.920
Please accept it, Iro-chan.

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:15.780
Auntie!

00:16:32.390 --> 00:16:33.200
Iro!

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:35.060
So this is where you were.

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:36.430
Where's Auntie?

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:37.800
Let's just go home.

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:39.490
Don't come here anymore.

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:41.310
No!

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:42.400
Iro!

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:43.160
Iro!

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:45.100
Auntie!

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:46.370
Auntie!

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:47.960
Auntie!

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:20.180
Auntie!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:29.900
East Ward
Day Room

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:32.610
Who is it?

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:34.240
Auntie!

00:17:34.810 --> 00:17:35.870
I'm here!

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:37.630
Auntie!

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:39.510
My, welcome.

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:48.350
It's a drawing that won a competition.

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:51.380
The principal was overjoyed.

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:52.750
That's mine.

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:56.150
Oh, you drew it?

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:58.680
I guess you'll be an painter in the future.

00:17:58.900 --> 00:18:01.430
An art teacher would be nice, too.

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:02.930
Auntie?

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:05.960
I'm sorry for bringing that up so abruptly.

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:09.440
Where's the class log? 
You're on duty today, yes?

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.090
What's your name?

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:14.410
Oh...

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:17.950
Who might you be, again?

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:40.090
Help me!

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:47.060
Switch...

00:18:47.590 --> 00:18:50.900
Switch with Iro!

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:54.660
But Iro's Iro.

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:57.200
There's always been only one.

00:18:58.690 --> 00:19:01.120
Why did Auntie...

00:19:01.630 --> 00:19:02.940
Why?!

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:19.920
Sniff, sniff.

00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:22.120
It stinks.

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:24.220
It smells like nail polish.

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:25.640
Nail polish?

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:29.850
Where'd you get that?

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:32.570
Here's your present.

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:36.410
Become a lovely woman who'll 
look great with her nails painted.

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:37.300
I will!

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:39.680
One more thing.

00:19:40.970 --> 00:19:45.060
If I ever forget about you,

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:47.790
then tell me.

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:50.250
Tell me your name.

00:19:52.760 --> 00:19:53.920
What do I do?

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:54.790
Iro...

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:57.780
broke her promise with Auntie.

00:19:57.780 --> 00:19:59.420
Auntie didn't do anything wrong!

00:20:00.040 --> 00:20:02.430
Iro left Auntie alone!

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:04.970
Wanna go?

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:08.060
I wanna go, but...

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.430
I wanna go.

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:14.880
Let's go, then.

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:17.520
Yeah.

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:30.320
Auntie.

00:20:34.470 --> 00:20:36.000
Who might you be?

00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:48.350
I'm Iro.

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:51.360
Irodori Iroha-senpai.

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:51.360
Irodori Iroha-senpai.

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:59.480
Ah, welcome, Iro-chan.

00:21:06.020 --> 00:21:06.860
Cocona!

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:08.800
Papika?

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.790
We did it, Cocona!

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:13.090
Auntie remembered us!

00:21:13.090 --> 00:21:14.040
Yeah.

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:16.600
But why did Senpai...

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:19.950
Let's go ask her tomorrow 
if it really was her!

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:21.300
It's like we're checking answers.

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:22.940
<i>Checking answers?</i>

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:25.040
<i>Did you do the homework?</i>

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:26.410
<i>What was it, again?</i>

00:21:28.520 --> 00:21:29.800
Excuse us.

